{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05这类仅停留18至19秒的段落中，未分时出现的感受词和交替行数偏多，容易让观众来不及消化；Y的左右分栏反而更容易快速扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然信息更多，但【】把每段真正重要的心理变化凸显出来，观众可以先抓叙事主线，再从较小的感受字里获得音乐和身体层面的细节。尤其在人物从克制、害怕失去，到愿意坦然表达、接受未来不确定性的过程中，X把动机变化和情绪转折交代得更充分，前后也有更清楚的呼应。Y的阅读路径更简洁，但右侧不少感受词容易变成彼此并列的情绪标签，人物为什么产生这些感受、它们如何推动下一步心理变化，没有X那么清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aba063d5-ee9a-4c7f-b282-de55ed1e42b9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T205910075184Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:00:34.056583+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c0334aa595909ff9f4448c79f8ce2ebba449d4e4f000016ad3088963c967d64d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa3